<title>USA: American offers Labor Day specials.</title>
<headline>American offers Labor Day specials.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMR Corp's American Airlines and American Eagle will be offering special Labor Day fares that range from $68 roundtrip from New York to Boston to $258 roundtrip from Los Angeles to Newark, New Jersey.</p>
<p>The carriers said the specials are available throughout a five-day period and require a three-day advance purchase.</p>
